OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,FLabour candidate Bev Craig has won the
OL,7,Flargest by-election in British history
OL,8,Fas she was voted in as Greater
OL,9,FManchester mayor, succeeding Andy
OL,10,FBurnham in the job.
OL,12,FThe result was announced late on
OL,13,FFriday night, more than 24 hours after
OL,14,Fpolling stations closed, in a
OL,15,Fcomfortable win, although with a low
OL,16,Fturnout.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
