OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785559664
OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,FMore than two million people were
OL,7,Feligible to vote in the contest,
OL,8,Ftriggered by Mr Burnham's election to
OL,9,FParliament last month, but the turnout
OL,10,Fwas just under 25%.
OL,12,FMr Burnham, who swiftly became Prime
OL,13,FMinister after winning the Makerfield
OL,14,Fby-election in June, won 63% of the
OL,15,Fvote in the 2024 mayoral election
OL,16,Funder the "first past the post"
OL,17,Fsystem, in which the candidate with
OL,18,Fthe most votes is declared the winner.
OL,26,@xD@KOUxD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
