OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,FIn her victory speech at Manchester's
OL,7,FCo-Op Arena Live, Ms Craig said: "To
OL,8,Fhave trust placed in you is an honour.
OL,10,F"I'm honoured, I'm humbled and I stand
OL,11,Fready to serve the three million
OL,12,Fpeople that live across this fantastic
OL,13,Fcity region. I will serve every single
OL,14,Fone of them, every single day.
OL,26,@oD@bOUrD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785559664
OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,F"I never believed as a girl growing up
OL,7,Fon a council estate that one day I
OL,8,Fwould have the chance to stand for the
OL,9,Fplace that I love, the place in this
OL,10,Fworld that I'm proud to call home and
OL,11,Fto offer my service to make our city
OL,12,Fregion better.
OL,14,F"Greater Manchester's potential lies
OL,15,Fin its future and when Westminster
OL,16,Fwalked away from us, when we were
OL,17,Fstruggling as a deindustrialised city
OL,18,Fregion, it was the people in this
OL,19,Fplace that began the journey to
OL,20,Frebuild."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU|D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785559664
OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,FShe continued: "For too many people
OL,7,Facross our region, life is simply too
OL,8,Fhard. The generational belief that we
OL,9,Fhad, that if you work hard and do the
OL,10,Fright thing, your life will be better
OL,11,Fand the life of the community will be
OL,12,Fbetter, is something that many people
OL,13,Fjust don't feel at the minute.
OL,15,F"And that's the challenge that we in
OL,16,Fpolitics have to face as well.
OL,26,@nD@POUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785559664
OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,F"And it's why I set myself a simple
OL,7,Ftask and I make that commitment to you
OL,8,Ftoday. That every single decision I
OL,9,Ftake, as your Mayor of Greater
OL,10,FManchester, will pass the test of
OL,11,Fmaking your life better."
OL,13,FMs Craig went on: "So, the hard work
OL,14,Fbegins. I've done it with a promise
OL,15,Fand a plan, and my promise to you is
OL,16,Fthat I will leave this city region
OL,17,Fbetter.
OL,19,F"We have to move away from divisive
OL,20,Fpolitics that tries to pit neighbour
OL,21,Fagainst neighbour.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@YO]uD@SOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
