PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785559664
OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,F"We will work together, we will do it
OL,7,Ftogether, we will deliver it together
OL,8,Fand we will build a Greater Manchester
OL,9,Fthat works for all of us, that we are
OL,10,Fall part of, where everyone feels
OL,11,Fwelcome and everyone has the chance to
OL,12,Fsucceed."
OL,14,FMr Burnham was blocked from standing
OL,15,Fin the Gorton and Denton by-election
OL,16,Fin February in part because Labour's
OL,17,Fruling National Executive Committee
OL,18,Fdid not want to put the party's
OL,19,Fcontrol of Greater Manchester at any
OL,20,Frisk.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
