OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,FThe May elections which triggered the
OL,7,Fdeparture of Sir Keir Starmer as prime
OL,8,Fminister saw some big losses in
OL,9,FGreater Manchester, including in
OL,10,FTameside where Labour lost its
OL,11,Fmajority in the Greater Manchester
OL,12,Fcouncil after an uninterrupted run of
OL,13,F47 years in charge.
OL,15,FAnalysis of the full votes showed that
OL,16,FMs Craig topped the poll in the first
OL,17,Fround of voting in all the 10 local
OL,18,Fauthority areas that make up Greater
OL,19,FManchester.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
