OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785559664
OL,3,CLabour wins Greater Manchester mayoral
OL,4,Cby-election after marathon vote count
OL,6,FMs Astley came second in eight of the
OL,7,F10 areas, while the Green candidate
OL,8,FGeraldine Coggins came second in
OL,9,FManchester and the Conservative
OL,10,Fcandidate Phil Eckersley was second in
OL,11,FTrafford.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
